data_pts2
# Phase identity: cxr-mc crystal catalog entry [pts2].
# Bundled full-basis P1 CIF used by the declarative material catalog.
# Catalog provenance and assumptions:
# Layered 1T-PtS2 (P-3m1; Materials Project mp-762). The JARVIS optB88-vdW
# relaxation gives a=b=3.590 A and c=5.106 A; the S 2d height z=0.252 is
# reported for the P-3m1 phase. The weakly bonded layers stack along c, so the
# catalog uses a c-axis-normal slab.
# Validation: pts2-p3m1-structure
_symmetry_space_group_name_H-M 'P 1'
_symmetry_Int_Tables_number 1
_cell_length_a 3.59
_cell_length_b 3.59
_cell_length_c 5.106
_cell_angle_alpha 90.0
_cell_angle_beta 90.0
_cell_angle_gamma 120.0
